Xuanji uses the Tianshu runtime and portions of its command-driver text and
compatibility anchors. The Android loading adapters add environment context,
session todo access, event restoration, authenticated command routes and
short-command history presentation. These adapters modify loaded code; the
bundled upstream files remain on disk. See app/src/main/assets/android-runtime/
and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the changes and their attribution.

